          "heading": "",
          "scene": "一个醒目的红色求救按钮图标，连接着两位老师的电话。",
          "image": null,
          "assetExpected": "S01_Mobilization/S01_Safety_Alert.png",
          "list": null,
          "paragraphStart": 0
